  "bodyHash": "8ph6G9JbJVg=",
  "content": "<p><center><a title=\"https://cobblemon.com\" href=\"https://cobblemon.com\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/aerodactyl_banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"660\" /></a></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\">Cobblemon 是一款面向 Fabric 和 NeoForge 的开源宝可梦模组。</font></span></center></p>\n<p><span>Cobblemon 的目标是成为人人都能享受的宝可梦模组，并且比其它宝可梦模组更好地融入整合包和 Minecraft 本身。我们的源代码是开放的，不仅鼓励社区贡献，也允许分叉（fork）。</span></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<center><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2tsCcWbiYgA?si=zAfUCC1MLsPih05i\" title=\"YouTube 视频播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></center>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"4\"><strong><em>功能特性（目前已有！）：</em></strong></font></span></center></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>捕捉宝可梦来扩充你的队伍，与野生宝可梦战斗获取经验，升级解锁新招式，并让宝可梦进化。有超过 700 种宝可梦可以捕捉！</span></li>\n<li><span>使用基于 <a title=\"https://pokemonshowdown.com\" href=\"https://pokemonshowdown.com\"><span><em>Pokémon Showdown!</em></span></a> 引擎的战斗系统，实现精准的竞技对战机制。</span></li>\n<li><span>一些《传说 阿尔宙斯》风格的机制，例如回忆招式、从战斗中物理逃跑，以及由你决定何时让宝可梦进化。</span></li>\n<li><span>战斗中可切换自由移动。你可以在宝可梦对战时建造、挖矿或攻击怪物！</span></li>\n<li><span>使用图鉴记录你看到和捕捉的宝可梦。图鉴还带有扫描功能，可以分析野生宝可梦！</span></li>\n<li><span>骑乘你的宝可梦，在 Minecraft 世界中时尚地探索！</span></li>\n<li><span>你可以在多人模式中与朋友进行交易和对战。</span></li>\n<li><span>使用牧场功能，让宝可梦在你想要的地方自由漫步！</span></li>\n<li><span>可以在野外找到树果，种在耕地上，覆盖覆盖物以获得加成，并通过杂交变异出新的树果。</span></li>\n<li><span>将作物和树果放入酿造台即可制作药品。酿造的药剂能回复更多生命值！</span></li>\n<li><span>世界中有古代建筑可以探索。其中一些建筑内有镀金宝箱，可能包含珍贵的战利品或其他惊喜！</span></li>\n<li><span>在特定位置挖掘可疑的沙砾或沙子可以找到化石，然后使用复活机器将其复活。</span></li>\n<li><span>第1代到第9代的所有宝可梦都能生成并与之对战，但如果它们还没有模型，则会以替身娃娃的形式显示。</span></li>\n<li><span>支持许多生物群系模组，包括 <span><a title=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/terralith\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/terralith\"><em>Terralith</em></a></span>、<a title=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/biomesyougo\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/biomesyougo\"><span><em>Oh The Biomes You'll Go</em></span></a> 和 <a title=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wwoo\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wwoo\"><span><em>William Wythers' Overhauled Overworld</em></span></a>。还有越来越多其他模组也得到支持！</span></li>\n<li><span>完全支持使用数据包和资源包添加自定义变体或幻兽种。你可以通过<a href=\"https://cobblemon.com/guides/custompokemon.html\">我们的指南</a>了解如何操作！<span></li>\n<li><span><a title=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/cobbled-farms\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/cobbled-farms\"><em>Cobbled Farms</em></a> 是一个由我们的团队打造的教程世界，以互动方式引导你了解模组的功能。它也随我们的官方整合包一同提供！</span></li>\n<li><span>同时支持 Fabric 和 NeoForge——不过我们推荐在 Fabric 上游玩，因为它性能更好！</span></li>\n<li><span><strong><em>……还有更多即将到来！</em></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>安装指南</strong></font></span></center></p>\n<p><span><strong><em>Fabric：</em></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>需要与你 Minecraft 版本对应的推荐版 <span><a title=\"https://fabricmc.net/\" href=\"https://fabricmc.net/\">Fabric Loader</a></span>。</span></li>\n<li><span>需要 <span><a title=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\">Fabric API</a><span>。</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span>将 Fabric API 和 Cobblemon-Fabric 放入 mods 文件夹。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span><strong><em>NeoForge：</em></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>需要与你 Minecraft 版本对应的推荐版 <span><a title=\"https://projects.neoforged.net/neoforged/neoforge\" href=\"https://projects.neoforged.net/neoforged/neoforge\">NeoForge</a></span>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">需要 <span style=\"color: #333399;\"><a style=\"color: #333399;\" title=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/kotlin-for-forge\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/kotlin-for-forge\">Kotlin for Forge</a><span style=\"color: #000000;\">。</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span>将 Kotlin for Forge 和 Cobblemon-NeoForge 放入 mods 文件夹。</span></li>\n</ul>\n&nbsp;\n<p><span>就是这样，你可以开始玩了！如果安装遇到问题，可以通过下方链接加入我们的 Discord 获得帮助。</span></p>\n<p><span>或者，你也可以在 <span><a title=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/cobblemon-fabric\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/cobblemon-fabric\">Modrinth</a></span> 或 <span><a title=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/cobblemon-fabric\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/cobblemon-fabric\">CurseForge</a></span> 下载官方 Cobblemon 整合包！我们推荐使用 <span><a title=\"https://modrinth.com/app\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/app\">Modrinth App</a></span> 下载整合包，但 <span><a title=\"https://prismlauncher.org\" href=\"https://prismlauncher.org\">Prism Launcher</a></span> 也是一个很好的替代启动器，可以从这些站点下载整合包。</span></p>\n<p><strong><em>注意：</em>Cobblemon 没有官方服务器。</strong> 你可以在我们的 <a title=\"https://cobblemon.com/en/servers\" href=\"https://cobblemon.com/en/servers\">网站</a> 或 Discord 的 #server-listings 频道中找到公共服务器列表，并将其添加到多人游戏菜单。或者，你也可以从 <a title=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/cobblemon\" href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/cobblemon\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></a> 等主机商处购买自己的服务器。</p>\n<p><center><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/bisect_banner2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2172\" height=\"360\" /></center></p>\n<p><center><span><strong><em><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></em></strong></span></center></p>\n<p><span><strong><em>注意：</em></strong>Cobblemon 模组仍在开发中并持续更新。许多功能尚在制作中或为临时占位，直到完成。一些现有功能也会随着我们的推进得到进一步完善。未来还计划添加更多功能，包括但不限于 NPC、骑乘宝可梦、繁殖系统和建筑结构。<br /></span></p>\n<p><span>加入我们的 Discord 以关注开发进度、与团队交流、提问，并抢先了解即将推出的功能！</span></p>\n<p><center><a title=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\" href=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/discord_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"224\" height=\"50\" /></a><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>捕捉宝可梦来填满你的图鉴！</strong></font></span></center></p>\n<p><center><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/b35c1c743230736b7f1a658681b9e2474551d3de.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"951\" height=\"534\" /></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>使用图鉴的扫描功能分析宝可梦！</strong></font></span></center></p>\n<p><center><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/3867190664feae606c624ebda171faf5a2289c1b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"951\" height=\"534\" /></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>在由 Pokémon Showdown 驱动的宝可梦对战中战斗！</strong></font></span></center></p>\n<p><center><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/9da617c7af3e4db862db86f9224cb7ed0a89d061.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"500\" /></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>将宝可梦放入牧场，让它们在世界上自由漫步！<br /></strong></font></span></center></p>\n<p><center><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/a44d47d5cef64865f82e73f67e92bf127d1d0a67.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"500\" /></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>寻找树果，种植树果农场，并进行树果杂交！</strong></font></span>&nbsp;</center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/7e70e7b6c9f7d3fe755a5d56877cdc108da5dd7f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"500\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>挖掘化石并将它们复活成古代宝可梦！</strong></font></span>&nbsp;</center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/cf697ecf20efc8aa3c3a5c535ff21b686db39cce.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"500\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>探索新的建筑结构，勇敢面对秘密试炼，寻找宝藏！</strong></font></span>&nbsp;</center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/739bfe6d514e52f34aa342d5bb96fe4c75e2d3d6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"500\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"4\"><strong><em>许可协议：</em></strong><em>&nbsp;</em></span><span><em>模组的二进制文件和源代码采用 Mozilla Public License 2.0 许可，允许公开修改和分叉，但前提是修改版也必须采用 MPL 2.0 许可。</em></font></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"4\"><strong><em>Cobblemon 与宝可梦或 Minecraft 均无关联。</em></font></strong></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"4\"><em>Minecraft 是 Mojang Synergies AB 的商标 ｜ 宝可梦是 Nintendo、Creatures Inc. 和 GAME FREAK inc. 的商标。</em></font></span></center></p>",
